<title>HONG KONG: Guangzhou Inv interim net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Guangzhou Inv interim net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.43     vs 8.49</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5	vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    208.94   vs 208.75</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,212.87 vs 1,039.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 24-31</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Guangzhou Investment engages in property development and investment in Hong Kong, Macau and China and provides property management and consultancy services.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on a weighted average of 2.48 billion shares vs 2.46 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
